INSERT INTO public."Block" VALUES (424, 108, '{"type": "richText", "content": "<ol class=\"scrollerInner__36d07\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Messages sur Newbie guide\" data-list-id=\"chat-messages\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\">\n<li id=\"chat-messages-1412860841342140506-1412860841342140506\" class=\"messageListItem__5126c\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"message__5126c cozyMessage__5126c groupStart__5126c wrapper_c19a55 cozy_c19a55 zalgo_c19a55\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"article\" data-list-item-id=\"chat-messages___chat-messages-1412860841342140506-1412860841342140506\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"Message\" aria-labelledby=\"message-username-1412860841342140506 uid_1 message-content-1412860841342140506 uid_2 message-timestamp-1412860841342140506\" aria-describedby=\"uid_3 message-reactions-1412860841342140506\">\n<div class=\"contents_c19a55\">\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>Hello new player, here you can find some tips and guides to help you out when you start the game</strong></div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"message-content-1412860841342140506\" class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>GENERAL</strong></div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">1)&nbsp;<strong>Optimal routine for each day :<br></strong>- You can reroll daily four times, buying tickets with a discount, units you want ( usually the common ones, and sometimes relic,&nbsp;<br>- Complete daily quests for 100 gems and 4 tickets,&nbsp;<br>- Watch ads three times to double rewards from games&nbsp;<br>- Watch 3 ads to get gems, tickets and silver from the scalluck lottery.<br>- watch an add for a small buff with the fortune card</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- You can also watch ads to get 5 free tickets<br><br></div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">2)<strong> Currencies :&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>- Silver</strong> is obtained by killing humans in coop mode - the more you play, the more silver you get. Large quantities of silver is also awarded by clearing tower of humanity - more than playing coop mode - but it is only one-time reward. Silver should be mainly spent for rerolling store, buying tickets and relics from store, upgrading demon gods and lastly buying units from store. Leftover silver can be spent on upgrading runes and upgrading units</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">Notes : Focus on upgrading white and green units ! Those are your early game units and usually decide all the start of your game<br>Higher base units means easier start and by the same way easier game !</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>- Gems</strong> are mainly obtained from drawing boards. On average, one ticket gives you 20 gems. Tower of Humanity also awards gems, but again - it is one-time reward. Gems should be mainly spent buying discounted tickets in store. Leftover gems can be used to buy skins for demon gods, undiscounted tickets in store and supreme demon gods locked behind demon god requirements (currently Asura, Omen, Clara, Cannon, Eggby). It is usually not suggested to buy other supreme demon gods, as they can be unlocked using tickets.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">Notes : Recently liberations were added : you want to buy liberation stones with gems after you got enough levels on the god you want to liberate<br><br>Basically : buy tickets with gems if you need eyes to upgrade gods, buy lib stones if you need them for a liberation</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>- Drawing tickets</strong> is the main currency in the game since it can give every other of them !</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">You can get tickets almost everything but the greatest ammounts come from playing&nbsp;<br>Tickets draw can give you base units, gems, tickets, relic and demon stones (eyes) <br>They also gives a chance to unlock secret drawing board. Secret drawing board offers better rewards, but must be completed somewhat quickly. I suggest stopping drawing normal board at 50 tickets, so if you unlock the secret board you can easily complete it. After unlocking hell mode a super secret drawing board may spawn from secret drawing board: I suggest stopping drawing normal board at 75 tickets then just in case you get one later.<br><br><strong>- Demon god stones&nbsp;</strong>is the currency used to level up every of you god (and usually the one you want the most to make your team stronger)<br>You can get those \"eyes\" usually with tickets&nbsp;<br><br>- <strong>Magic dust</strong> is the currency used to roll up traits, some buffs that will improve your gameplay and strengthen your units by a lot (you earn it in Hell and Abyss modes)<br><br><strong>- Liberation stones</strong> are the currency used for liberation, a late game feature that gives a giant boost to some gods (detailed guide about it later)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"buttonContainer_c19a55\">\n<div class=\"buttons__5126c container__040f0 isHeader__040f0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Actions des messages\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contents_c19a55\">\n<div id=\"message-content-1412860907918332078\" class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">3)<strong> Demon runes</strong> unlock after levelling up enough.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">The three best runes are ancient gold coin (1st rune), negotiations (2nd to last) and ancient mana stone core (2nd rune)</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">Only level up those till they are at least level 10 in this order of priority (if you don''t have negociation yet cause you need level 13 for it, level up the Mana stone core.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>NORMAL MODE<br><br></strong></div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">To clear Normal mode for the first time you have 2 options<br><br>1) Ask for a carry. Either on Discord or on global chat. Many players can solo normal mode with ease. You can ask what you carry want but 99% of players should beat it easily solo.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">2) Beat it and solo it by yourself. The best way to do that is unlocking clara, should be easy with the rewards you get when you start the game<br>Then you can just put one ice knight in th emiddle if you have it and spam clara, or just spam clara and maybe some witches on the bottom if you can<br><br>You should get nice rewards for beating normal. <br>Notes : To unlock hard, you need to clear normal via find match (with random player). With correct strategy, this is very easy even with lvl 1 units.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>HARD MODE</strong> <br><br>Same as Normal mode you have 2 options <br><br>1) Ask for a carry. Your partner may have special instructions for you to help him carry you.<br>2) Beat it with a good random or solo it with the clara strategy (one row of clara one ice knight one row of clara one row of witches)<br>Remember that mimic is your best friend for ressources make as many as you need<br><br>Notes : To unlock hell, you need to clear hard via find match (with random player). As long as you are skilled enough, this is easy and doable even with low level gods.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contents_c19a55\">\n<div id=\"message-content-1412860957352263881\" class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>GAME MECHANICS</strong></div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">1) Units do raw damage. Some gods do also extra % damage - damage based on max HP of target. To kill final boss of normal mode/ hard mode, you will need % damage, as he has too much HP to be killed with only raw damage at low levels, except with high level units.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">2) % damage cannot be increased by crits nor by increasing damage (for example from ancient blue dragons). However, if the unit gets speed boost (from witch doctor), it will result in more % damage over time. In hard and hell mode, %HP damage is not scaling with shield: enemy with 100M HP and 200M shield will take 5M damage from 5% maxHP attack.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">3) In battle, you can upgrade units using stones to increase their damage (this feature is usually useless, you want to use it only when you''re done building and have blue stones to spend). Abilities increasing attack are based on base damage (white numbers). For example, a unit with 30k base damage will get +30k damage from a level 1 blue dragon (+100%).</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">4) Base crit rate is roughly 15%. Base crit damage is roughly +100%. Extra boss damage is nearly useless.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">5) Support units (witch doctor, ancient blue dragons) apply their bonus to partner too, and bonuses stack additively: if you make 4 lvl 1 witch doctors, both you and partner''s units will have their speed doubled.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">6) In-battle demon god upgrade will increase damage of units based on their type: Clara will get different bonus than slime. This upgrade does not depend on unit level; lvl 1 Clara will get the same damage boost as lvl 21 Clara. This boost is usually dramatically bigger than raw damage of unit, but still not that useful nowadays.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">7) Slow effects do stack but only for different units: if a tile is covered by 3 different Ice Knights, it is the same is if it were covered by one. Big Hand''s slow from relic however will be add to the slow from Ice Knight (in a multiplicative way).</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contents_c19a55\">\n<div id=\"message-content-1412860960821219389\" class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">8) Stunning stunned enemy will refresh stun duration. If enemy from previous wave is still on board, he will get 20% chance to ignore stun (meaning attacks are less likely to stun him). If he is on board for 2 waves, the chance rises to 40%. This continues until enemy has 100% chance to resist stun and becomes unstunnable.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">9) Unless specified otherwise, units will attack the closest enemy.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">10) To kill final boss of hell mode, you need damage scaling with shield or insane damage output (cannon and eggby are best for this)</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li id=\"chat-messages-1412860841342140506-1412861026143309977\" class=\"messageListItem__5126c\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"message__5126c cozyMessage__5126c wrapper_c19a55 cozy_c19a55 zalgo_c19a55\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"article\" data-list-item-id=\"chat-messages___chat-messages-1412860841342140506-1412861026143309977\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"Message\" aria-labelledby=\"message-username-1412860907918332078 uid_1 message-content-1412861026143309977 uid_2 message-timestamp-1412861026143309977\">\n<div class=\"contents_c19a55\">\n<div id=\"message-content-1412861026143309977\" class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>DEMON GOD TIER LIST (Without liberations, but still good to start)</strong></div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">S: Used in almost 100% of your games</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Witch Doctor (massive global increase to attack speed, try to make at least 4 witches every game),&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Mimic (economy),</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Ice Knight (slows down enemies, improving AoE attacks. Best paired with destroyer for stunlock)</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">A: Best Carry Units, Usually top Meta for low difficulties</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Clara (use minigun, her bombs do massive AOE %hp damage, she has great raw damage too and can stun, best unit in the game for beginners by far),&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Eggby (hatches after some time to buff random god freeing tile. Not needed in normal/ hard, but yellow Eggby is the best-anti boss for hell mode), <br>- Helicopter (active ability allows you to switch places with another unit - allowing you to move units into better position, his relic give a lot of crit damage on the first tile he''s moved on, making the dps here much stronger in most cases),</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Destroyer (Best stun in the game without lib),</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">B: Great but not meta in lower difficulties</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Phantom Slime (press upgrade button in battle to attempt to upgrade him. Success improves damage and attack speed. Failure resets upgrades to 0. Go for slime+3. Not affected by witch''s speed buff (but gets crit buff). Very high raw damage, but lacks % damage to deal with bosses , that''s why he''s usually paired with yellow eggby. Great for early game),<br>- Asura (make 4 different Asura pieces, then merge it. Get 100% crit chance (witch doctor relic). Add more Torso pieces to it for greater crit dmg and raw damage increase. Can be upgraded in-battle using stones. Once per battle can activate convergence might to kill all non-boss units in game. Asura has amazing raw damage but bad % damage. Needs a lot of resources to upgrade, but if upgraded, it is very powerful. Overkill for normal and hard modes)</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Master Cat (average raw and % damage (relic), but very good AoE (hits everything in range. Useless in hell mode. If placed on top row with lvl 4 eye of the demon eye relic cat can hit partner''s half too),</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Cannon (anti-boss, anti-bounty),</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Oni (average raw and OK % damage. Low shield damage, but it gets very good after level 11, great anti boss)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contents_c19a55\">\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"message-content-1412861030803177593\" class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">C: Mid</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Big Hand (his slow add with the ice knight slow making ennemies almost immobile, not op but can be useful)</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Omen (save up souls by hitting enemies, then activate for massive raw and hp% damage. Very high scaling with level; needs level 11+ to be somewhat good,</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Coinman (massive raw damage if you save up hundreds of thousands of coins (using either mimics or bikers). No % damage),&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Goblin Biker (hit enemies to generate gold. Needs witches for higher attack speed and crit rate, needs stun so he has always something to attack. Only useful for Coinman, otherwise waste of a tile),</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Ancient Blue Dragon (damage increase is mostly irrelevant, but crit damage increase from relic helps some gods, he''s just not that good in lower difficulties)</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">D: Bad units or only relevant in some very rare case</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Surprise mouse (high raw damage, bad % damage. Witch''s speed buff has reduced effect, but works without support),&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Scalluck (spend gold to try to upgrade. Success increases damage, failure reduces damage. Upgrade for 15+. OK raw damage, no % damage. Needs lots of gold to be upgraded),&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">- Space Soldier (kill enemies to increase damage. Needs witches or Regik for 100% crit rate. Good for normal mode, but damage is too low for hard mode/ hell mode. With the liberation he''s the best unit in the game though), <br>- Regik (increases crit rate of gods next ot him, good for early game, great for afk farming with liberation gods).&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">E: - Scalluck (spend gold to try to upgrade. Success increases damage, failure reduces damage. Upgrade for 15+. mid raw damage, no % damage. Needs lots of gold to be upgraded. Worst unit in the game),&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li id=\"chat-messages-1412860841342140506-1412861069592100894\" class=\"messageListItem__5126c\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"message__5126c cozyMessage__5126c wrapper_c19a55 cozy_c19a55 zalgo_c19a55\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"article\" data-list-item-id=\"chat-messages___chat-messages-1412860841342140506-1412861069592100894\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"Message\" aria-labelledby=\"message-username-1412860907918332078 uid_1 message-content-1412861069592100894 uid_2 message-timestamp-1412861069592100894\">\n<div class=\"contents_c19a55\">\n<div id=\"message-content-1412861069592100894\" class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>OPENING</strong> 1) Summon units so you can kill the 1st bounty. You may upgrade common-rare units a couple levels, but this will be unnecessary as you get stronger. 2) Upgrade mines to lvl 5, then summon more units. Complete all white, green and blue missions. a) This includes the following secret mission: have all 7 different white units at the same time, have all 7 different green units at the same time, have all 7 different blue units at the same time b) White outline means, that you can merge a unit. Green outline means that you have 3+ of given unit. Use this to merge faster. c) Get used to summing and merging units quickly; time is a valuable resource. d) make sure to check which mission you completed (so you know which units you can merge right away) and which not (so you know which units you can''t merge yet). e) reroll units if you are full and still need have missions to complete. 4) Get your first god. a) Do not upgrade units, especially do not upgrade epic-legendary units. It is a waste of stones. b) I suggest rerolling purple units for a merge once you get 4 purple units. 5) Once you get your first god, spend all coins into mines. Keep rerolling that god until you get destroyer to make mimics. Repeat until you max out mines. a) Hard mode modification: get two gods during opening. One of them should be mimic, one of them should be AoE to deal with enemies (slime, clara, cat and so on. Ice works too)</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li id=\"chat-messages-1412860841342140506-1412861101690982534\" class=\"messageListItem__5126c\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"message__5126c cozyMessage__5126c wrapper_c19a55 cozy_c19a55 zalgo_c19a55\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"article\" data-list-item-id=\"chat-messages___chat-messages-1412860841342140506-1412861101690982534\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"Message\" aria-labelledby=\"message-username-1412860907918332078 uid_1 message-content-1412861101690982534 uid_2 message-timestamp-1412861101690982534\" aria-describedby=\"uid_3 message-reactions-1412861101690982534\">\n<div class=\"contents_c19a55\">\n<div id=\"message-content-1412861101690982534\" class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>BASIC STRATEGIC CONCEPTS</strong> 1) Prioritize making witch doctors as they buff your partner too. Make units so they can attack your partner''s enemies too. 2) Area of effect (AoE) units benefit from ice (slows down enemies, making theme more compact, making your AoE hit more enemies) and stun (destroyers stack up enemies, making your AoE attack more enemies at once, and for longer). 3) Positioning of your units matters. It is worth making helicopter to improve positioning of your units. a) Helicopter also allows you to reroll less - if you for example want ice, 3 destroyers and 4 claras in exact position, you can make them anywhere in any order, then move them in correct positions with helicopter. 4) Work on your opening and early game. It is the most important part of the game. Get faster with merging and summoning units. When you are low on gold, get mimic. Memorize missions so you can complete them quicker. 5) This is a strategic game. You can clear hell mode with lvl 1 gods with correct strategy. a) That being said, the most impactful upgrade is level of white units (early game), level of common relics (economy) and runes (economy). 6) If your account level is low, you will usually be paired with bad partners. Try to team up with players from global chat, Discord or friend. Stronger partner will make the game significantly easier and can teach you new tactics.</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"markup__75297 messageContent_c19a55\"><strong>SUPPORTS </strong>You can contact <strong>support</strong> by going in the main menu (where you join games) -&gt; three lines near the right corner -&gt; settings -&gt; support. You can report bugs there or give feedback - developers actively listen to feedback and implement things players want.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ol>"}', 1, NULL);
INSERT INTO public."Block" VALUES (436, 86, NULL, 4, NULL);
INSERT INTO public."Block" VALUES (390, 102, '{"type": "richText", "content": "<h3>Lucky Defense</h3>\n<p>The game that started it all. A defining modern tower defense game built around engaging systems, satisfying upgrades, strategy, and a rewarding amount of build variety. We&rsquo;ve been covering Lucky Defense since early launch, tracking mechanics, upgrades, and balance changes as the game evolves. Our goal is to help players understand the systems quickly and build better runs, faster.</p>"}', 8, NULL);
